{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/64988-los-angeles-wod-table-at-strategicon-feb-14-17","id":64988,"title":"Los Angeles: WOD table at Strategicon Feb 14-17","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-04T11:04:56-08:00","id":64988,"title":"Los Angeles: WOD table at Strategicon Feb 14-17","content":"The Dead Gamers Society will be on hand at Strategicon: Orc Con in Los Angeles this President's Day weekend, Feb 13-17, 2014, running a collection of World of Darkness table top RPG's for your gaming pleasure.<br /> <br /> The schedule is as follows:<br /> <br /> <b>Saturday 9:00am<br /> Orange Is The New Pack - Werewolf the Forsaken</b><br /> Welcome to Hexford Correctional Facility &amp; Mental Institution. On a good day Big Bubba will shank you for your peanut butter and jelly sandwich. On a bad day, you wont have time to scream to the prison guards for help. And why are people always transferred into Hexford, but no records show anyone transferring back out?<br /> <br /> <b>Saturday 2:00pm<br /> Honey and Vineger - Demon the Descent</b><br /> I was an angel. I wasn\u2019t an angel of vengeance, or an angel of mercy, or even an angel of death. I was an angel of the Machine. I came to Earth wrapped in a Cover that the Machine provided, and I served. Service didn\u2019t make me happy, but it made me what I was. An angel. But then I stopped serving. Why? It\u2019s complicated. You were involved. That\u2019s all I\u2019ll say for now. I stopped serving, and when I did, I Fell. And what does that make me?<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Saturday 8:00pm<br /> The Spanish Tragedy - Vampire the Requiem, Blood and Smoke</b><br /> Prince Vidal, ruler of the New Orleans Kindred, has only successfully sired once. One of his Theban mystics told him that his childe would bring about the downfall of the New Orleans Kindred. Vidal had him locked away, with no human contact, save for a lone scholar to educate him and keep him from going entirely mad. But now, with torpor growing near, Vidal's heart has softened, and he's taking his childe out of prison to see if he can become a legitimate heir. The PCs are the honor guard, keeping the child<br /> <br /> <b>Sunday 9:00am<br /> The Call of the God Machine - World of Darkness: The God Machine Chronicles</b><br /> Something strange is going on at the Elton Assisted Living Community. The management is trying to sweep it under the rug, but he families who have elderly parents who live there have had enough and are taking matter into there own hands as they investigate what is going on. They say that the residents mindless wander the grounds at night mumbling strange things and whisper of something called the God Machine<br /> <br /> <b>Sunday 2:00pm<br /> My Bloody Valentine - World of Darkness: The God Machine Chronicles</b><br /> February 14th is a day for lovers. Or a singles party. Six friends are attending the latter at one of their number's new apartment in a Historical Building downtown. Several drinks later things get weird. One hangover later and the six are alone....Elsewhere. They say that Love finds a way. They never said that way would be pleasant.<br /> <br /> <b>Blood Moon - V20: Vampire the Masquerade</b><br /> You stalk in the shadows, moving gracefully and unseen among their prey. You are a blood-drinking fiend of whispered legends - a Kindred, a Cainites, a Damned. Above all, you are a vampire. Your eternal struggle, waged since the nights of Jericho and Babylon, plays itself out among the skyscrapers and nightclubs of the modern world.<br /> <br /> Strategicon is a series of gaming conventions held in Los Angeles three times a year (President's Day weekend in Feb, Memorial Day weekend in May and Labor Day weekend in Sept). To learn more about Strategicon, visit there website at Strategicon.net<br /> <br /> The Dead Gamers Society: The So Cal World of Darkness meetup is a World of Darkness RPG club based in Southern California. We organize and host open invite gaming events through out the region. Our mission is to grow and nuture a local network of World of Darkness table top RPG gamers and fans. To learn more about the DGS, visit their site at <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\">www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/</a><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:georgia\">Organizer for the Dead Gamers Society: The So Cal World of Darkness Meetup. </span><a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/</a>","edited":{"userid":85,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/85-drumheller","user":"Drumheller","date":". 02-05-2014, 11:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/85-drumheller","name":"Drumheller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar85_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-16T07:59:02-08:00","id":73189,"title":"","content":"Some pics from our table top events:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i162.photobucket.com/albums/t261/jlburgos_bucket/600_333718512_zps3bafd97b.jpeg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Assistant Organizer for:</b><br /> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i162.photobucket.com/albums/t261/jlburgos_bucket/a41e98d1-1eed-4506-a8d2-2b3bea4a43da_zps469395ad.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attach